CLASS kHGwlIAZUQfihQNtbCZJmgPrpXDFKn DEFINITION FINAL.
  PUBLIC SECTION.
    INTERFACES zif_abapgit_object_filter.

    METHODS constructor
      IMPORTING
        it_filter TYPE zif_abapgit_definitions=>ty_tadir_tt.

