CLASS zcl_abapgit_diff_diff3 IMPLEMENTATION.
  METHOD compute.
* Beware: this is AI generated code -Hvam 2025-09-29
    DATA: lv_new      TYPE string,
          lv_old      TYPE string,
          lv_new_last TYPE c LENGTH 1,
