START-OF-SELECTION.
  PERFORM run.

* Hide Execute button from screen
AT SELECTION-SCREEN OUTPUT.
  IF sy-dynnr = lcl_password_dialog=>c_dynnr.
    lcl_password_dialog=>on_screen_output( ).
  ELSE.
