  ENDIF.

* SAP back command re-direction
AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON EXIT-COMMAND.
  PERFORM exit.

AT SELECTION-SCREEN.
  IF sy-dynnr = lcl_password_dialog=>c_dynnr.
    lcl_password_dialog=>on_screen_event( sscrfields-ucomm ).
  ENDIF.

